flowchart TB
    UI[PHNX Profile UI] --> PM[ProfileManager]
    PM --> DB[Room + SQLite\nProfileEntity]
    PM --> SM[ProfileStorageManager]
    PM --> CM[Chromium Context Factory]
    PM --> Tabs[Profile-scoped TabManager]
    SM --> Private[Android application-private storage]
    CM --> ContextA[Profile A browser context]
    CM --> ContextB[Profile B browser context]
    ContextA --> DataA[Cookies • LocalStorage • IndexedDB • Cache]
    ContextB --> DataB[Cookies • LocalStorage • IndexedDB • Cache]
    PM --> Lifecycle[Lifecycle state machine]
    PM --> Recovery[Safe writes + crash recovery]

